    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The banished leader of Heltor Silenos. A fanatic follower of Baium, he believes that Baium must be resurrected and will then wipe out all other tribes throughout the continent. Alone in his belief, he and his minions search the Tower of Insolence for a way to resurrect Baium. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. One-handed Blunt Weapons Lv. 5 Blunt Weapons Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
